  "content": {
    "title": "ATMs",
    "intro": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The ATM API lets a TPP retrieve ATM location and service data published by LFIs. It is a read-only, public-data API — no user consent or redirect is required."
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "Bank Data Sharing Provider",
        "level": 2,
        "anchor": null,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Access to the ATM API requires the BDSP role. This role must be assigned to your application in the Trust Framework before calling the endpoint. See Roles for the full list of scopes and grant types this role permits."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "A single GET /atms call returns all ATMs published by an LFI. Each ATM record includes:"
          }
        ],
        "subsections": []
      },
      {
        "heading": "Which LFIs are live with ATM data",
        "level": 2,
        "anchor": null,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "LFIs currently publishing ATM data across UAE Open Finance."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Live data is currently unavailable."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "No LFIs are currently active for this capability."
          }
        ],
        "subsections": []
